<title>INDIA: INDIA-BMSL quotes on state gilt and bonds-June 18.</title>
<headline>INDIA-BMSL quotes on state gilt and bonds-June 18.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Birla Marlin Securities said it made the following two-way quotes on Wednesday for state Government securities and bonds</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Particulars		    Bid/Offer</p>
<p>----------------------  ------------</p>
<p>13.05% Tamilnadu state  100.45/100.90</p>
<p>2007</p>
<p>13.05% Gujarat state    100.45/100.95</p>
<p>2007</p>
<p>13.75% GOI 2005	   104.75/105.25</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>* Quotes are available from BMSLs dealing room in Mumbai, at the telephone no. 2855051, 2824350 (Vikram and Navneet)</p>
<p>* Lot size one million rupees.</p>
</text>
